OL,3,GNEWSARescued turtles to be released in
OL,4,Athe Azores
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rare turtle that was flown to the UK
OL,7,Fafter being rescued in Jersey has been
OL,8,Ftransported to the Azores, along with
OL,9,Ftwo others, where they will be released
OL,10,Flater.
OL,12,FThe loggerhead turtle, named Crush by
OL,13,Fher rescuers, was found lifeless on a
OL,14,Fbeach on 19 January following Storm
OL,15,FGoretti.
OL,17,FMalnourished and suffering from
OL,18,Fhypothermia, she was flown to
OL,19,FSouthampton and transferred to Weymouth
OL,20,FSea Life centre where she has been
OL,21,Fcared for by experts.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
