OL,3,GNEWSARescued turtles to be released in
OL,4,Athe Azores
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter a period back in quarantine,
OL,7,FCrush has been flown 1,500 miles
OL,8,F(2,500km) to the Azores, along with
OL,9,Ffellow loggerheads Eden and Tiree who
OL,10,Fwere rescued on the west coast of
OL,11,FScotland in 2025.
